{"steam_appid":2613890,"steam_name":"Icaria","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2613890/284835955/01c28e2b5160230b9244ea33040c35aaf25d18a2/1781593480/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1781636286","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257360155/279e17da7ffdb91efb9ba373267b1683657c9234/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1781636286","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613890/ss_a9a782ed0cb596b4147dee780feae21cf218d19e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781637725","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613890/ss_42c5a2605415109c5bc64713c76300b73863c419.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781637725","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613890/ss_17a1e1096982a5b4da5038a9a315148a92e9ca58.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781637725","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613890/6c0ab7c5f0b7cf71b5334c13b091f29ee8eaa568/ss_6c0ab7c5f0b7cf71b5334c13b091f29ee8eaa568.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781637725","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613890/32301491fc340f10db7b2d8e00beb2d2a48f61f1/ss_32301491fc340f10db7b2d8e00beb2d2a48f61f1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781637725"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate a team of robots to gather resources, reshape terrain, and scale up factories on a procedurally generated alien world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a procedural world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game you are exploring a different planet, with a different set of resources and biomes that present unique challenge. You start able to only see a small area, but as you progress you build out a radio network and unlock more of the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613890/extras/133369ab56f92a64bcf550b6370fa677.poster.avif?t=1781637725\" width=544 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613890/extras/133369ab56f92a64bcf550b6370fa677.webm?t=1781637725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613890/extras/133369ab56f92a64bcf550b6370fa677.mp4?t=1781637725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding your colony requires ever increasing quantity of resources. Luckily, the planet you're on is ripe with them to find and use. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613890/extras/f0d92090bf7335228e582bdb569ee3d1.poster.avif?t=1781637725\" width=544 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613890/extras/f0d92090bf7335228e582bdb569ee3d1.webm?t=1781637725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613890/extras/f0d92090bf7335228e582bdb569ee3d1.mp4?t=1781637725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Programming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anything you can do you can automate. It becomes a necessity as your colony grows larger, and recipes get more complex. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613890/extras/497e41e30e8725c7ac446c7df5b11544.poster.avif?t=1781637725\" width=544 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613890/extras/497e41e30e8725c7ac446c7df5b11544.webm?t=1781637725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613890/extras/497e41e30e8725c7ac446c7df5b11544.mp4?t=1781637725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Single-player colony-builder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Automatable robots and factories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Procedurally generated voxel world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mutable terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An easy-to-learn visual scripting language</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sharable scripts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fog-of-war and power mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trucks for long-distance transit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trees that grow, die, and can be farmed</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4+ thread processor from the last 10 years<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon Graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4+ core processor from the last 5 years<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Simulation"],"developers":["Blindsight Games LLC"],"publishers":["Blindsight Games LLC"],"release_date":"16 Jun, 2026"}